# Obsidian editor state — per-device, rewritten by the app on every focus change.
# A host vault may version its own .obsidian/; this repo does not version editor state.
.obsidian/

# JetBrains project state (same reason: per-machine, not content).
.idea/

# The append-only trail (log/mat.md, log/agt.md, round artifacts) is local-only: it names people,
# machines and accounts. The contract lives in AGENTS.md; the content never leaves this machine.
log/
